## 🧱 Tech Stack

| Tool/Tech         | Description                          |
|------------------|--------------------------------------|
| ⚛️ React (with TypeScript) | Modern component-based frontend     |
| ⚡ Vite            | Fast dev server and build tool       |
| 🎨 Tailwind CSS   | Utility-first CSS framework          |
| 🧩 Shadcn/UI + Radix | Beautiful UI components             |
| 🗣️ Web Speech API  | For speech recognition & synthesis   |
| 🌍 OpenWeatherMap | Fetches real-time weather data       |
| 📍 ipapi.co       | Retrieves user’s location via IP     |
| 🧠 Groq API (Mistral) | AI model for chat responses (stubbed in demo) |

